TestWrBuf:
   Call Erase 'TWB * A'
   I=0
   I=I+1; A.I = "TWB      START X'20000'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         USING *,12"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         LR    12,15"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         LR    2,14"
   TargetRecord = I
   I=I+1; A.I = "         CNOP  0,4"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         BAL   1,DOIT"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    CL8'WRBUF'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    CL8'TWB'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    CL8'ASSEMBLE'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    CL2'A'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    AL2(0)"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    AL4(BUFFER)"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    AL4(L'BUFFER)"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    C'F'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    X'20'        FORM=E"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    AL2(1)"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    AL4(0)"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    F'" || TargetRecord || "'         FORM=E recno"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    F'1'         FORM=E norec"
   I=I+1; A.I = "DOIT     SVC   202"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         DC    AL4(1)"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         BR    2"
   I=I+1; A.I = "BUFFER   DC    CL80'Blivet banana BLORF?'"
   I=I+1; A.I = "         END"
   A.0 = I
   Call Assemble 'A.', 'TWB'
   'LOAD TWB ( START'
   A.TargetRecord = "Blivet banana BLORF?"
   'EXECIO * DISKR TWB ASSEMBLE A (STEM O.'
   Call Erase 'TWB * A'
   Call AssertStemEqual 'A.', 'O.'
   Return

Assemble:
trace o
   Parse arg CodeStem . , FN .
   Do I = 0 to Value(CodeStem || '0')
      Line.I = Left(Value(CodeStem || I), 80)
   End
   'EXECIO' Line.0 'DISKW' FN 'ASSEMBLE A 1 F 80 ( FINIS STEM Line.'
   Call NoError 'WITHSTEM OUTPUT SYSTERM. COMMAND ASSEMBLE' FN '( DISK'
   If RC <> 0 then Do I = 1 to SysTerm.0
      Say SysTerm.I
   End
   Return

Erase:
   'SET CMSTYPE HT'
   Call NoError 'ERASE' Arg(1)
   'SET CMSTYPE RT'
   Return
